---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CategoryCard from '../../components/CategoryCard.astro';
import ToolCard from '../../components/ToolCard.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

import { toolsByCategory } from '../../data/tools';
const tools = toolsByCategory['developer'] || [];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Developer Tools | SolversPro"
  description="Free web developer tools: 30+ utilities including JSON/XML Formatters, Format Converters, Code Beautifiers, Diff Checkers, String Escapers, Base64/JWT Decoders, and Data-to-Class Generators."
>
  <Header />
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-6xl">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[
      { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
      { label: 'Developer Tools' },
    ]} />
    <div class="mb-12 mt-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Developer Tools</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-zinc-300">
        <h2>Web Developer Tools & Data Formatters</h2>
        <p>Welcome to the SolversPro Developer Hub. When you're deep in the code, the last thing you need is a clunky utility that forces you to upload your sensitive API payloads to a third-party server. Our suite of free online developer tools is built by engineers, for engineers.</p>
        <p><strong>Privacy is our primary feature.</strong> Every single tool in this category—from our JSON formatter to our JWT decoder—runs entirely locally in your web browser using client-side JavaScript. Your data never touches our servers. You can safely paste production API keys, sensitive customer JSON, or proprietary XML schemas knowing that they are secure.</p>
        
        <h3>Tools Available in this Category</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4 mb-6">
          <li><strong>JSON Formatter & Validator:</strong> Paste minified, unreadable JSON and instantly format it into a beautifully indented, syntax-highlighted tree. Validate against structural errors before pushing code.</li>
          <li><strong>XML Formatter & Validator:</strong> Tackle legacy systems and SOAP APIs with ease. Beautify dense XML strings and convert them into readable formats instantly.</li>
          <li><strong>Format Converters:</strong> Seamlessly translate between JSON, XML, YAML, and CSV formats. Perfect for migrating configs, analyzing API responses, or bridging legacy systems.</li>
          <li><strong>Data-to-Class Generators:</strong> Instantly convert JSON payloads into typed classes or interfaces for TypeScript, Java, Python, C#, and Go. Save hours of boilerplate typing.</li>
          <li><strong>Text & Data Diff Tools:</strong> Compare two blocks of JSON, XML, or plain text line-by-line with color-coded highlighting for additions, deletions, and modifications.</li>
          <li><strong>Code Beautifiers:</strong> Format compressed HTML, CSS, and JavaScript into clean, readable code with configurable indentation settings.</li>
          <li><strong>String Escapers:</strong> Safely embed strings into HTML, XML, JSON, SQL, or CSV by escaping special characters and preventing injection vulnerabilities.</li>
          <li><strong>Base64 Encoder & Decoder:</strong> A daily necessity for front-end developers. Safely encode text strings or decode Base64 data back into readable text for debugging.</li>
          <li><strong>JWT Token Decoder:</strong> Inspect the header and payload of your JSON Web Tokens. Verify claims, expiration dates, and algorithms without compromising your token's security.</li>
          <li><strong>Cryptographic Hash Generator:</strong> Securely generate SHA-1, SHA-256, SHA-384, and SHA-512 hashes from any text input. Perfect for verifying data integrity and password hashing checks.</li>
          <li><strong>Color Code Converter:</strong> Streamline your CSS workflows. Instantly translate color values back and forth between HEX, RGB, and HSL formats with a visual preview.</li>
          <li><strong>Number Base Converter:</strong> Instantly convert between decimal, binary, octal, and hexadecimal bases simultaneously.</li>
          <li><strong>Regex Tester & Debugger:</strong> Test your regular expressions in real-time with visual match highlighting and capture group inspection.</li>
          <li><strong>Unix Timestamp Converter:</strong> Quickly translate Unix epoch timestamps into human-readable dates and relative times.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Stop wasting time searching for safe utilities. Bookmark our developer hub and process your data locally, instantly, and securely. Choose a tool below to get started.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      {tools.map(tool => (
        <ToolCard {...tool} />
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
